      "knowledge_points": [
        "Laurent展开",
        "三角函数的幂级数"
      ],
      "question_type": "Laurent展开",
      "method": [
        "幂级数展开"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "利用 $\\cos z$ 的Taylor展开",
        "除以 $z^3$ 得到Laurent展开"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "laurent_expansion_cosine",
        "template": "$\\frac{\\cos z}{z^n}$ 型函数的Laurent展开",
        "variable_count": 1
      },
      "difficulty": 2,
      "estimated_minutes": 7,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "完整解答",
          "steps": [
            "利用 $\\cos z = \\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty} \\frac{(-1)^n z^{2n}}{(2n)!} = 1 - \\frac{z^2}{2!} + \\frac{z^4}{4!} - \\frac{z^6}{6!} + \\cdots$：",
            "$$h(z) = \\frac{\\cos z}{z^3} = \\frac{1}{z^3}\\left(1 - \\frac{z^2}{2!} + \\frac{z^4}{4!} - \\frac{z^6}{6!} + \\cdots\\right)$$",
            "$$= z^{-3} - \\frac{z^{-1}}{2!} + \\frac{z}{4!} - \\frac{z^3}{6!} + \\cdots$$",
            "$$= \\frac{1}{z^3} - \\frac{1}{2z} + \\frac{z}{24} - \\frac{z^3}{720} + \\cdots$$"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "kobe-2025-07c5afeba8-q03-practice-02",
      "school": "神户大学",
      "year": "2025"
    },
    {
      "text": "求 $\\oint_{|z|=2} \\frac{e^z}{z(z-1)}dz$ 的值。",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "留数定理",
        "Cauchy积分公式",
        "部分分式分解"
      ],
      "question_type": "留数定理应用",
      "method": [
        "留数定理",
        "部分分式分解"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "识别奇点",
        "在圆内计算各奇点处的留数",
        "应用留数定理"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "residue_theorem_multiple_poles",
        "template": "含多个简单极点的有理函数的留数计算",
        "variable_count": 2
      },
      "difficulty": 3,
      "estimated_minutes": 10,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "完整解答",
          "steps": [
            "奇点为 $z = 0$ 和 $z = 1$，都在 $|z| = 2$ 内",
            "计算 $z = 0$ 处的留数：",
            "$$\\text{Res}\\left(\\frac{e^z}{z(z-1)}, 0\\right) = \\lim_{z \\to 0} z \\cdot \\frac{e^z}{z(z-1)} = \\lim_{z \\to 0} \\frac{e^z}{z-1} = \\frac{1}{-1} = -1$$",
            "计算 $z = 1$ 处的留数：",
            "$$\\text{Res}\\left(\\frac{e^z}{z(z-1)}, 1\\right) = \\lim_{z \\to 1} (z-1) \\cdot \\frac{e^z}{z(z-1)} = \\lim_{z \\to 1} \\frac{e^z}{z} = \\frac{e}{1} = e$$",
            "由留数定理：",
            "$$\\oint_{|z|=2} \\frac{e^z}{z(z-1)}dz = 2\\pi i(-1 + e) = 2\\pi i(e - 1)$$"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "kobe-2025-07c5afeba8-q03-practice-03",
      "school": "神户大学",
