        "得到 $f(z)$ 的Taylor展开（可去奇点）",
        "计算积分"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "removable_singularity_taylor",
        "template": "$\\frac{\\sin z}{z}$ 型可去奇点函数",
        "variable_count": 1
      },
      "difficulty": 2,
      "estimated_minutes": 8,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "完整解答",
          "steps": [
            "利用 $\\sin z = z - \\frac{z^3}{3!} + \\frac{z^5}{5!} - \\cdots$：",
            "$$f(z) = \\frac{\\sin z}{z} = 1 - \\frac{z^2}{3!} + \\frac{z^4}{5!} - \\frac{z^6}{7!} + \\cdots$$",
            "这是 $z = 0$ 处的Taylor展开式（$z = 0$ 是可去奇点）",
            "Laurent展开中没有 $z^{-1}$ 项，所以 $\\text{Res}(f, 0) = 0$",
            "$$\\oint_{|z|=1} f(z)dz = 2\\pi i \\cdot 0 = 0$$"
          ]
        }
      ],
